          "kicker": "Coaching philosophy",
          "heading": "Fiji chairman says Jake White won't boot flair into touch",
          "body": "Fiji's chairman says Jake White will not boot the team's flair into touch as they pursue their World Cup quest, Reuters reports. It sits alongside White's own message after Saturday's 34-28 win over Japan in Tokyo: he knows Fiji play with flair, but his focus has been on control, structure and organisation. White has said he believes Fiji can be a massive force at next year's World Cup in Australia if he can assemble his best 33 players."
