          "kicker": "Contract news",
          "heading": "England scrum-half Jack van Poortvliet commits future to Leicester Tigers",
          "body": "Jack van Poortvliet has signed a new deal with Leicester Tigers, the 25-year-old club vice-captain who has won 27 England caps and made 118 appearances for the club since debuting in 2019. He also has an 'Elite Player Squad' contract for 2026-27. Tigers head coach Geoff Parling said: \"Jack is a brilliant player, developed through our academy, and an important leader in our group.\" Van Poortvliet, who grew up supporting Leicester, called the decision to stay 'a pretty easy' one."
