          "heading": "Wallabies flanker Rob Leota signs with Clermont until January 2027",
          "body": "Rob Leota, the 21-cap Wallabies flanker, has signed with Clermont after leaving Bayonne as a free agent. The 29-year-old has committed to the Auvergne side until 31 January 2027, as Clermont wait on several injured players. Coach Christophe Urios said: \"It's always difficult to find an additional player at this time of year.\" Leota is not among the 33 players Les Kiss named on Friday for the November Nations Championship games."
