          "heading": "Japan's Fiji defeat remains the men's story; no new team news today",
          "body": "Today's coverage in the pack carries no new Japan men's team news, so the centenary Test is still the reference point. Fiji beat Japan 34-28 at Chichibunomiya on Saturday, a month after the Brave Blossoms had beaten them 20-15 in the Pacific Nations Cup final in September. The defeat leaves Japan 10th of 12 in the log, with Wales away in Round four next."
