          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Richie Mo’unga still not ruled out as All Blacks injury list grows",
          "body": "Captain Ardie Savea is one of several All Blacks now unavailable as the injury toll grows ahead of the Nations Championship campaign in Europe, joining prop Tyrel Lomax, hooker Samisoni Taukei’aho and loose forward Shannon Frizell on the sidelines. Frizell faces six weeks after rupturing his left posterior cruciate ligament, while Taukei’aho is expected to be out four to six weeks with a torn calf. The one hopeful note is flyhalf Richie Mo’unga, who has not yet been ruled out after missing both Bledisloe Cup Tests with a calf tear."
        },
