          "heading": "Planet Rugby breaks down Springboks' eight Test defeats since 2023",
          "body": "South Africa have lost eight Tests since the start of 2023, and Planet Rugby has gone through the defeats to draw up what beating them requires. Across those eight, the winning side averaged 29.9 points and six of them scored 25 or more, so scoring capacity comes first. The Springboks head to Europe for the November leg of the Nations Championship, with Italy in Turin first, then France and Ireland."
        },
